  "observations": [
    "The reopened 600×460pt content stays the same size across all four pages, including the English Screenshots tab. Wide-window coverage asserts a 900pt window with a centered 768pt scroll area, including 24pt margins per side.",
    "A real file-write failure at the isolated preference owner restores the confirmed transparency and camera color and keeps separate retry targets. A successful transparency retry preserves the pending camera error.",
    "Two native onboarding pages are rendered in each appearance. This review mode does not establish persistent deferral during ordinary Finder launch.",
    "The camera uses full-color swatch images so actual appearance and selected shape remain visible under AppKit button tinting.",
    "Restart compared isolated media hashes and identities, all preference documents, SQLite operations and start rows."
